Full license text: https://www.flaticon.com/license

File notes
----------
- 262 icons, PNG, 512x512, rectangular style with rounded corners.
- Filenames are lowercase country/territory slugs (e.g. indonesia.png).
- Two filenames were corrected from the site's own typos:
  malasya.png -> malaysia.png, kwait.png -> kuwait.png
- The pack lists "Tuvalu" twice as two different icons; they are kept as
  tuvalu.png and tuvalu-2.png.
